  "details": "Video footage: https://streamable.com/wo91y\n\nTo reproduce the bug, you can take pretty much any humanoid avatar and run it against a wall. Jumping against the wall isn't required to trigger the broken animation, as you can simply walk against the wall to break the body's animation.\n\nThe only similar bug I can find to this in live release are movement-related animations occasionally breaking during custom movement animations (though occasionally, custom models will break with the default movement animations), where the head would simply refuse to move.",
